[
  {
    "bg": "outside",
    "location": "巷口",
    "clock": "星期四 · 13:48",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "母亲把地址发来时，只说家里还要修几天，让我去舅公那里住。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "outside",
    "location": "巷口",
    "clock": "星期四 · 13:48",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "我在药店门口下车。软糖的包装换了颜色，还是橘子味的。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "outside",
    "location": "巷口",
    "clock": "星期四 · 13:48",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "走进巷子，门牌末尾的数字掉了半截。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "outside",
    "location": "巷口",
    "clock": "星期四 · 13:48",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "还没按门铃，门就开了。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "outside",
    "location": "巷口",
    "clock": "星期四 · 13:48",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "到了？包给我。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "outside",
    "location": "巷口",
    "clock": "星期四 · 13:48",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "我",
    "text": "不重。我自己拿吧。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "outside",
    "location": "巷口",
    "clock": "星期四 · 13:48",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "车上热不热？冰箱里有水果。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "outside",
    "location": "巷口",
    "clock": "星期四 · 13:48",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "他领口的一边翻到里面。我伸手想替他理一下，他已经转身往屋里走。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "outside",
    "location": "巷口",
    "clock": "星期四 · 13:48",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "这几天你就住这里吧。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "房间还是楼上那间。被子昨天晒过了。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "我",
    "text": "我还记得。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "你小时候来，也是睡那间。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "我把包放在椅子上。椅子没响。舅公却指了指旁边。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "那张别坐。坐这个。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "门边只摆着两双拖鞋。我穿的这双很新，底下没有砂子。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "我又看了眼合照。边上怎么空了那么大一块？"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "椅子旁边挂着一件灰蓝外套。袖口磨得发亮，左边口袋有一道白线。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "我",
    "text": "有人在吗？"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "没。先放着，省得找。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "电视突然亮了一瞬。里面左边有一个坐着的人，右边的椅子空着。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "一下又黑了。我还以为谁碰了开关。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "下午他们还要来做节目。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "我",
    "text": "又来？"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "你小时候还看过呢。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "他把摄像机拿出来，又去厨房拖出插线板。我给他让了点地方。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "这次把杯子放干净的地方。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "我",
    "text": "什么杯子？"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "桌上的。别放边上。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:06",
    "audio": "house",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "桌上还没有杯子。他打开厨房的门，我也跟进去拿了一个。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "二姨婆来的时候没有拎豆角。她空着手，还是问我怎么又瘦了。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "二姨婆",
    "text": "是不是不按时吃饭？"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "我",
    "text": "刚在车上吃过。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "二姨婆",
    "text": "车上吃的算什么饭。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "胡爷爷已经在右边坐下了。我没听见他进门。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "左边的位子暂时空着。舅公把灰蓝外套搭到那个位子的靠背上。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "我",
    "text": "林爷爷今天不来？"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "来了。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "我朝门口看了看。地上只有我和舅公的鞋。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "电视糊得厉害。左边的椅子在屋里空着，屏幕上倒坐着人。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "今天的客人，都来齐了。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "没有人纠正他。他清了清嗓子，把话筒拿近一点。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "第一个问题。今天中午吃了什么？"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "左边传来一句：昨天剩的面。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "是电视里的声音。我把头转过去。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "那不算今天的。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "画面停住了。胡爷爷的嘴还张着，人却已经把茶喝完。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "lowres",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "我没告诉他。他正低头解围巾。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "still",
    "id": "loop2-observe",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "舅公在调话筒。大家等着他把声音调小。",
    "choices": [
