  },
  {
    "bg": "photo-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "合照里只有四个大人。最边上空着，照片边缘还在。",
    "id": "loop2-photo"
  },
  {
    "bg": "photo-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "左边那个人的脸上，有几道很细的铅笔线。轮廓比其他人的更清楚。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "photo-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "我隔着玻璃摸了一下。是画在照片上的，不是相框上。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "photo-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "我那件小外套还在，袖口的颜色和现在这件很像。",
    "next": "loop2-observe"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "outline",
    "closeTV": true,
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "电视上还是两个人，一左一右。图像停着，声音却没停。",
    "id": "loop2-tv"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "outline",
    "closeTV": true,
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "左边那个人的脸像被谁顺着眉毛、鼻子和下巴描了一遍。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "outline",
    "closeTV": true,
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "画面滚了一下，中间多出一个模糊的人影。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "outline",
    "closeTV": true,
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "我凑过去，已经只剩原来的两个人。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "outline",
    "closeTV": true,
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "摄像机的镜头罩没摘。边缘上还能看见一条松着的绳子。",
    "next": "loop2-observe"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
