        "opacity": 1
      },
      "animation": "none"
    },
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "我叫麦子。它从厨房门口抬起头，过了很久才站起来。",
    "id": "loop2-pet"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
